        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethanol fermentation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethanol fermentation plant
Ethanol plant with an annual capacity of 90 000 tons ethanol and a life time of 20 years .;
UUID: 82771312-7ae9-3f97-bee8-a88e5e35512c
Ethanol plant infrastructure including  transformation and occupation of land, materials, energy uses,  emissions, and dismanteling
Location: The inventory is modelled with data from a plant in the USA.
Technology: Ethanol fermentation plant with wheat as resource. 
Time period: Literature
Production volume: 90000 tons per year
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_82771312-7ae9-3f97-bee8-a88e5e35512c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
